# The build needs .docker/ (patch set + recipes) and the vendored openpi-client and robometer-client;
# everything below is data or generated output that should not be sent as build context.
#
# packages/robometer is the Robometer SERVER checkout (a submodule). It runs in its own environment,
# never inside this image -- its torch/transformers pins cannot coexist with OmniGibson's -- so it is
# excluded here; only the thin packages/robometer-client goes in.
packages/robometer/
data/
datasets/
logs/
tmp/
images/
custom_assets/
*.sif
*.zip
.git/
.venv/
.idea/
.claude/
**/__pycache__/
**/.thumbs/
*.npy
slurm-*.out
